# Unstable Experiment on the opponent: "target player" is not "you" (the card draws for Bot2, hand 6 -> 7), while the creature connives for
# its own controller Bot1 (draws Island, discards it: a land, so no counter and the Ornithopter stays 0/2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Unstable Experiment
Island x3
Island
Island
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x8

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
